OL,3,ATrump hints US would not back UK over
OL,4,AFalkland Islands due to lack of Iran
OL,5,Awar support
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump has hinted he would not
OL,8,Fcome to the UK's aid in a potential
OL,9,Ffuture conflict with Argentina over the
OL,10,FFalkland Islands.
OL,12,FIn an interview with GB News, the US
OL,13,Fpresident said that Britain had "not
OL,14,Fbeen there to help me" with his
OL,15,Fcountry's war with Iran, despite later
OL,16,Fsaying his military did not need any
OL,17,Fsupport.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
