OL,3,ATrump hints US would not back UK over
OL,4,AFalkland Islands due to lack of Iran
OL,5,Awar support
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrump's latest remarks come after he
OL,8,Fpreviously said the US could revise its
OL,9,Fneutral position on the islands'
OL,10,Fsovereignty if the UK failed to
OL,11,Fincrease defence spending.
OL,13,FArgentinian President Javier Milei is
OL,14,Fdue to make a televised statement on
OL,15,FThursday night about what he describes
OL,16,Fas his nation's "historic" claim to the
OL,17,Fislands.
